Andy,

That is possible. But forgive me, I was under the impression that if we use the scan function in our App to read the files and use the fileEncoding() and encoding() options to specify "UTF-8" encoding, things should be fine. Is that not so?

And another reason I did not pay attention to the dataset files was because I thought if an error should occur, it must occur only upon reading the files, and not at the very start of the application. No?

Apologies, had I known answers to these questions, I may have saved you the headache of this problem :) But I will make the changes, see if I succeed, and report back to select your post as an answer.

Many thanks.

