I am not an R expert yet, but it looks like sentiment was removed from CRAN and is now only on R-forge

However I did find that there may be another sentiment package you could use, per the article below.

http://stackoverflow.com/questions/15194436/is-there-any-other-package-other-than-sentiment-to-do-sentiment-analysis-in-r

Adding support for R-Forge is on our list of things to do, but isn't supported today yet unfortunately.

-Tareef

